      <td colspan="7" style="padding-top:0.01in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="font-size:7pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;top:-3.283pt;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:4.69pt;font-family:Arial;position:relative;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">1)</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;Excluding effects from capacity alignments and antitrust related matters. Non-GAAP measure, see reconciliation table.<br></font><font style="color:#000000;top:-3.283pt;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:4.69pt;font-family:Arial;position:relative;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">2)</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;Annualized operating income and income from equity method investments, relative to average capital employed.</font></p></td>
